ss likely: the targets in this encoding are stationary and never descend, and nothing suggests shooting.\n- Freeway, Frogger and maze games are ruled out because the agent never leaves the bottom row and there are no interior obstacles.\n- Pong is ruled out because it has no static reward blocks at the top.\n\n**Game:** Breakout (a mini Breakout/Arkanoid-style brick-breaker, like the MinAtar Breakout).\n\n**Description:** The agent controls a paddle on the bottom row and moves it left and right to keep a bouncing ball in play. Reward comes from the ball breaking the bricks in the top three rows, and missing the ball ends the episode.\n\n**Confidence:** 80%"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":79698,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":79698},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5caad76c-dc1e-4479-8203-e6348998e40b","uuid":"0bb45587-8bbc-4bbd-abec-b4ed8f369535","timestamp":"2026-11-03T02:06:50.200Z","request_id":"req_011CgfB6MkDU7oR3xfGVjb6k"}
